The Frog in the Well — asset sources & licences

Story       "The Frog in the Well" (井底之蛙), classical Chinese parable from the Zhuangzi (public domain), retold in original words.
Artwork     Drawn procedurally in code (print.js, nature.js, traveler.js, figures.js, views.js). Original compositions.
            Print engine, nature and traveller rig adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT License.
Music       Original score (music/score.py). Shamisen = physical model (core/audio/pluck.py).
            Shakuhachi from samples "flute" (VSCO 2 CE, Versilian Studios, CC0 1.0) and "recorder" (VCSL, CC0 1.0).
            Taiko / hyoshigi = synthesis + samples from VCSL (CC0 1.0) and FreePats world percussion (CC0 1.0).
Sound FX    Synthesized in code (mix.py + core/audio/sfx.py). No recordings.
Voice       Kokoro TTS v1.0 (kokoro-onnx), Apache-2.0 — voice bm_george.
Fonts       Shippori Mincho (FONTDASU), Yuji Syuku (Kinuta Font Factory) — Google Fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (subsets in fonts/).
